  "bodyHash": "42e4b6bffe769e9f",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_dd58dfe8-1df6-4e86-8569-b60fd4427e2b.png\" alt=\"Epic Knights of TerraFirmaGreg 標誌\" width=\"850\" height=\"472\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>作為原版《Epic Knights of TerraFirma》的作者，我終於為著名的模組包 TerraFirmaGreg-Modern 製作了一個相容移植版，因為兩者之間存在許多差異，導致基礎版 KOTF 無法直接與該模組包相容。</p>\n<p>有人可能會問，如果只是一個數據包就能解決問題，為什麼還要製作另一個模組和頁面呢？</p>\n<p>答案是，這個版本未來將獲得獨立支援，包含重新設計所有武器與護甲以適應該模組包（而非基礎 TFC），並且後續可能還需要在程式碼方面進行一些額外調整。</p>\n<p>以下說明僅複製自原模組頁面的描述，但會根據實際更新內容進行相應修改。</p>\n<p>請將所有問題回報至 GitHub Issues。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_2ced21a1-0607-42c4-bfeb-9346947b31c6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"62\"></p>\n<p>本模組旨在盡可能讓&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: Shields, Armor and Weapons</a></strong>&nbsp;及其擴充模組與&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrafirmacraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraFirmaCraft</a></strong>&nbsp;達成高度相容。在<strong>3.0</strong>版本中，<strong>Epic Knights of TerraFirma</strong> 包含了<strong><em>900 種以上</em></strong>的物品，涵蓋<strong>TFC</strong>生存模式中所有可用材質的<em>武器</em>、<em>盾牌</em>與<em>護甲</em>。<strong>Epic Knights</strong> 與 <strong>Epic Knights: Antique Legacy</strong> 的資源已重新製作以符合<strong>TFC</strong> 的美術風格，對應物品的數值也已重新平衡以契合<strong>TFC</strong> 的遊戲玩法。護甲屬性可透過設定檔進行自訂！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_975b12a1-f75e-40a4-8214-974698f1d3b4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"62\"></p>\n<p>自<strong>3.0</strong>版本起，<strong>Epic Knights of TerraFirma</strong> 模組已預設支援<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a></strong>，並且預計不會與其他模組產生衝突或問題。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_e0572cef-4c09-4f4d-b7a4-ff41983b0d5b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"66\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_274c52a1-3723-4435-b7c3-f21bb3ef0624.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"942\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_4fbbf070-ada0-4680-abbb-d890cb756057.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"65\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_c578c568-bb70-4f76-a01e-5bec8db26ff6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"710\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_16e51fed-094c-4478-b404-8d75e530a1e8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"67\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_5d77e783-308e-4640-ba39-446abb87407a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"260\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_32b0f980-0c3b-4ad4-946e-fc8787c94b3e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"571\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_3531e109-b66f-441c-a432-f631c79af3de.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"66\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_70c95701-bf7a-4465-8839-c804588652fa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"436\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_7ed83493-8ecd-43be-a973-aa0971ffe128.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"65\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_c2005522-0356-477d-961c-b8d23aede9e1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"712\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_b5637dd0-782e-4a25-b383-bf4141bd9adc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"476\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_bd8c0bcd-6573-493b-a6f4-76cf15ef5891.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"335\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_0434a30e-7e4f-49b6-8b9e-adbcbb28eb61.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"65\"></p>\n<p>目前的開發路線圖如下，哈哈：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>重新設計所有材質以符合 TerraFirmaGreg 的視覺風格。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>不過，這短期內應該不會實現。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_a1ededac-9c40-4f41-9faf-76c51167c006.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"65\"></p>\n<p>在此我要由衷感謝&nbsp;<strong>Magistu</strong>&nbsp;願意解答關於他模組內部細節的各種問題；感謝&nbsp;<strong>SomeIdiot13</strong>&nbsp;（目前使用的 Discord 暱稱）協助除錯與測試我的模組；感謝&nbsp;<strong>StaxiHD</strong>&nbsp;協助處理材質與德文翻譯；以及感謝&nbsp;<strong>MrHiTech</strong>&nbsp;創作了如此出色的數據包，最終演變成了本模組。另外也要特別感謝&nbsp;<strong>Yappit1</strong>、<strong>Seagullible</strong> 與 <strong>sossololpipi</strong> 在遊玩 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/terrafirmacultures-s2\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraFirmaCultures</a> 時協助測試與除錯我的模組。</p>",
